{"verb": "ice over", "audio": "audio/68 - winter/13-ice-over.mp3", "duration": 33.097, "transcript": "A small lake in northern Minnesota has begun to ice over for the first time this winter. Local officials have warned skaters and ice fishers to wait until the surface is fully thick enough to hold weight. Last year, two rescue teams were called out after thin ice broke under several visitors. The town will publish daily ice reports online starting next week. Residents are also being asked to keep dogs and small children away from the shoreline.", "words": [{"word": "A", "start": 0.1, "end": 0.14, "score": 0.517}, {"word": "small", "start": 0.2, "end": 0.501, "score": 0.817}, {"word": "lake", "start": 0.561, "end": 0.801, "score": 0.814}, {"word": "in", "start": 0.941, "end": 1.021, "score": 0.844}, {"word": "northern", "start": 1.081, "end": 1.442, "score": 0.86}, {"word": "Minnesota", "start": 1.482, "end": 2.062, "score": 0.888}, {"word": "has", "start": 2.202, "end": 2.363, "score": 0.902}, {"word": "begun", "start": 2.443, "end": 2.743, "score": 0.97}, {"word": "to", "start": 2.803, "end": 2.943, "score": 0.75}, {"word": "ice", "start": 3.083, "end": 3.224, "score": 0.882}, {"word": "over", "start": 3.304, "end": 3.524, "score": 0.71}, {"word": "for", "start": 3.664, "end": 3.804, "score": 0.573}, {"word": "the", "start": 3.864, "end": 3.944, "score": 0.979}, {"word": "first", "start": 4.004, "end": 4.245, "score": 0.83}, {"word": "time", "start": 4.305, "end": 4.605, "score": 0.615}, {"word": "this", "start": 4.725, "end": 4.906, "score": 0.888}, {"word": "winter.", "start": 4.986, "end": 5.306, "score": 0.903}, {"word": "Local", "start": 6.047, "end": 6.347, "score": 0.804}, {"word": "officials", "start": 6.427, "end": 6.868, "score": 0.831}, {"word": "have", "start": 6.988, "end": 7.168, "score": 0.822}, {"word": "warned", "start": 7.248, "end": 7.548, "score": 0.978}, {"word": "skaters", "start": 7.609, "end": 8.009, "score": 0.899}, {"word": "and", "start":